sequenceDiagram
    participant ML as ML Application
    participant Svc as feast-{project} Service<br/>6566/TCP
    participant FS as Feature Server<br/>FastAPI/Python 3.12
    participant Reg as Registry Server<br/>8080/TCP
    participant Online as Online Store<br/>(Redis 6379 / PG 5432)
    participant Offline as Offline Store<br/>(BigQuery / Snowflake)
    participant Op as Feast Operator<br/>Go Controller
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP
    participant OCP as OpenShift API<br/>6443/TCP
    participant CronJob as CronJob Pod

    Note over ML,Online: Flow 1: Online Feature Retrieval
    ML->>Svc: POST /get-online-features<br/>Auth: OIDC/K8s token<br/>TLS (when configured)
    Svc->>FS: Forward request
    FS->>FS: inject_user_details<br/>(validate token, check permissions)
    FS->>Online: Query features<br/>TCP, TLS (optional)<br/>Auth: Password/Credentials
    Online-->>FS: Feature values
    FS-->>Svc: JSON/Protobuf response
    Svc-->>ML: Feature response<br/>TLS (when configured)

    Note over CronJob,Online: Flow 2: Feature Materialization (CronJob)
    CronJob->>K8s: kubectl exec feast-{project} pod<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    K8s->>FS: Execute materialization command
    FS->>Offline: Read historical features<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Cloud IAM/Credentials
    Offline-->>FS: Historical feature data
    FS->>Online: Write to online store<br/>TCP, TLS (optional)<br/>Auth: Password/Credentials
    Online-->>FS: Write confirmation

    Note over Op,OCP: Flow 3: Operator Reconciliation
    Op->>K8s: Watch FeatureStore CRs<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8s-->>Op: FeatureStore CR events
    Op->>K8s: Create/Update Deployments,<br/>Services, ConfigMaps, RBAC,<br/>CronJobs, ServiceMonitors
    Op->>Reg: GET /api/v1/permissions<br/>HTTP(S)/8080<br/>Auth: Bearer token (intra-comm JWT)
    Reg-->>Op: Permission policies
    Op->>K8s: Create Roles/RoleBindings<br/>(auto-access RBAC)
    Op->>OCP: GET apiservers<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    OCP-->>Op: TLS profile configuration
